      <KnowledgeArticles>
        <KnowledgeArticle ElementID="HybridSolutionsCloud.HyperVPrivateCloud.Capability.SDN.IntegrationHealth.Monitor" Visible="true"><MamlContent><maml:section xmlns:maml="http://schemas.microsoft.com/maml/2004/10"><maml:title>Summary</maml:title><maml:para>Validates the local Network Controller Host Agent identity and service, plus the optional Software Load Balancer Host Agent. Microsoft.Windows.10.SDNMonitoring remains authoritative for SDN resource discovery, leaf health, alerts, and performance.</maml:para></maml:section><maml:section xmlns:maml="http://schemas.microsoft.com/maml/2004/10"><maml:title>Operator response</maml:title><maml:para>Check the NcHostAgent and SlbHostAgent services, the NcHostAgent HostId registry value, and the matching Network Controller server InstanceId. Then follow the authoritative Microsoft SDN alert and troubleshooting guidance. This workflow performs no remediation.</maml:para></maml:section></MamlContent></KnowledgeArticle>
